# Galimi GUI build note (2026-10-06)
#
# Source: monero-gui master (d7c2f13), branch `galimi`, commit a03a1ce
# (rebrand). Core linked via symlink monero/ -> ../galimi (our fork).
# Configure: cmake .. -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DMANUAL_SUBMODULES=1
#   (MANUAL_SUBMODULES bypasses the submodule-head check for the symlinked fork)
#
# Rebrand applied:
# - main.qml: default mainnet daemon RPC port 18081 -> 28081
# - src/main/Logger.cpp: log dir .bitmonero -> .galimi
# - src/libwalletqt/Wallet.cpp: bitmonero.log -> galimi.log
# - src/main/main.cpp: app/org identity -> galimi-core / galimi
# - main.qml: window title "Monero" -> "Galimi"; desktop-entry + Tails strings
# - CMakeLists: project monero-gui -> galimi-gui
# - wizard: network dropdown mainnet-only (no testnet/stagenet)
# - QML display strings: standalone XMR -> GAL (identifiers untouched)
# - installers/windows/Monero.iss: AppName + registry keys -> Galimi
# - pages/Mining.qml: default RPC port help text -> 28081
#
# Deps installed on build VM: qtbase5-dev qtdeclarative5-dev
# qtquickcontrols2-5-dev, qml modules (controls2, dialogs, labs-settings,
# labs-folderlistmodel, graphicaleffects), qttools5-dev, libqt5svg5-dev,
# libqt5xmlpatterns5-dev, libgcrypt20-dev; external/quirc submodule inited.
#
# Build order: daemon/simplewallet first (running, proc_dc2da2ee78bf), then
#   cd build && make -j2
# on 2 cores — expect several hours. Daemon binary stays named `monerod`,
# which is what the GUI launches from its own directory.
